// Dialog :
"P2711653850" "Ah, the ID you got will be just the thing! Now, I'll have my agent begin her infiltration. I'll tell her comrades that she's been hiding from you here at Haven house. With my unimpeachable reputation, they'll have no reason to doubt me. <br><br>This information on Weaver-1 is troubling, though. This is the second time he's come up. There may be something larger going on."
// RandomFameString :
"P3651333751" "I heard that there were some rebellious Arachnos troops around Grandville. I wish I could be that brave."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P206824036" "I just got word from my dear Millia. Oh, that's right, you don't know who that is, do you? Well, I'll tell you. <br><br>Fortunata Millia is the infiltrator currently disguised as Fortunata Amelee, one of the leaders of the rebels you caught. Now, Millia says that she's found out who's trying to help the rebels. It's time for you to play the bad guy again, {VillainName}, and 'abduct' her."
// AcceptString :
"P3834361637" "'Abduct' Fortunata Amelee a.k.a. Millia"
// SendOffString :
"P1673395519" "Don't expect much help from Fortunata Millia. She'll have to stay 'in character', as it were, to keep her allies convinced that she's really Fortunata Amelee."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2759139661" "'Abduct' Fortunata 'Amelee'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2803106933" "As long as you can remember that Fortunata Amelee is really Fortunata Millia, this shouldn't be that bad."

